flowchart TB
  People[Students, Teachers, Administrators]
  Browser[Web browser: static HTML CSS JavaScript]
  Edge[HTTPS ingress / reverse proxy]
  Tunnel[Cloudflare Quick Tunnel - temporary testing only]
  App[Spring Boot monolith: REST controllers, services, validation]
  Security[Spring Security: role and ownership checks, JWT HttpOnly cookie]
  Flyway[Flyway schema migrations]
  DB[(MySQL-compatible database: local MySQL or TiDB)]
  Files[(Private filesystem upload directory)]
  Mail[Optional SMTP or Resend integration]
  Ops[Actuator health and Prometheus metrics]
  Backup[Operator-managed database and upload backups]
  People --> Browser --> Edge --> App
  Tunnel -. optional pilot route .-> Edge
  App --> Security
  Security --> DB
  App --> Flyway --> DB
  App --> Files
  App -. configured notifications .-> Mail
  App --> Ops
  DB -. scheduled operations .-> Backup
  Files -. scheduled operations .-> Backup
